 minotaurs scatter after their leader falls.","participants":["minotaurs","pallas","leandros"],"location":"one-eyed-pass","importance":"minor","page":"stories/walls-akros-2014-02-26","order":406,"story_date":"2014-02-26","storyline":"Born of the Gods","source":"wizards","paragraph":110,"quote":"they had seen their leader fall, and they were scattering.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/walls-akros-2014-02-26#:~:text=they%20had%20seen%20their,and%20they%20were%20scattering.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Walls of Akros","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kelly Digges"],"date":"2014-02-26","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/walls-akros-2014-02-26","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/walls-akros-2014-02-26#:~:text=they%20had%20seen%20their,and%20they%20were%20scattering.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Walls of Akros\" by Kelly Digges. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 26 Feb 2014."}},{"id":"walls-akros-2014-02-26-e13","era":null,"summary":"Diocles realizes the minotaurs lured and trapped the squad deliberately and says Akros must be warned.","participants":["diocles","minotaurs"],"location":"one-eyed-pass","importance":"major","page":"stories/walls-akros-2014-02-26","order":406,"story_date":"2014-02-26","storyline":"Born of the Gods","source":"wizards","paragraph":123,"quote":"The minotaurs are hunting the Alamon, deliberately.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/walls-akros-2014-02-26#:~:text=The%20minotaurs%20are%20hunting%20the%20Alamon%2C%20deliberately.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Walls of Akros","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kelly Digges"],"date":"2014-02-26","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/walls-akros-2014-02-26","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/walls-akros-2014-02-26#:~:text=The%20minotaurs%20are%20hunting%20the%20Alamon%2C%20deliberately.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Walls of Akros\" by Kelly Digges. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 26 Feb 2014."}},{"id":"walls-akros-2014-02-26-e15","era":null,"summary":"Leandros runs for a day and more past fallen Alamon squads and minotaur bands and reaches Akros at night.","participants":["leandros","the-alamon","minotaurs"],"location":"akros","importance":"minor","page":"stories/walls-akros-2014-02-26","order":406,"story_date":"2014-02-26","storyline":"Born of the Gods","source":"wizards","paragraph":142,"quote":"Occasionally he came upon squads of fallen Alamon","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/walls-akros-2014-02-26#:~:text=Occasionally%20he%20came%20upon%20squads%20of%20fallen%20Alamon","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Walls of Akros","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kelly Digges"],"date":"2014-02-26","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/walls-akros-2014-02-26","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/walls-akros-2014-02-26#:~:text=Occasionally%20he%20came%20upon%20squads%20of%20fallen%20Alamon","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Walls of Akros\" by Kelly Digges. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 26 Feb 2014."}},{"id":"walls-akros-2014-02-26-e16","era":null,"summary":"Leandros discovers the minotaurs have built a wall around Akros to keep the Alamon out while besieging the city.","participants":["leandros","minotaurs"],"location":"akros","importance":"major","page":"stories/walls-akros-2014-02-26","order":406,"story_date":"2014-02-26","storyline":"Born of the Gods","source":"wizards","paragraph":144,"quote":"A wall. Someone— minotaurs —had built a wall around Akros","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/walls-akros-2014-02-26#:~:text=A%20wall.%20Someone%E2%80%94%20minotaurs,a%20wall%20around%20Akros","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"